    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "A superb opportunity to acquire a substantial five-bedroom detached home in the highly sought-after and prestigious Ard Na Mara development in Malahide.\r\n\r\nNumber 141 offers generous accommodation throughout, with excellent potential for a new owner to enhance and modernise the property to create a wonderful family home. The property has been extended to the rear and also benefits from an attic extension, currently used as a bedroom, with a bathroom located on this level.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation is complemented by a very large rear garden, offering excellent outdoor space and considerable scope for further enhancement, subject to the necessary planning permissions. The west-facing living accommodation enjoys an abundance of natural light throughout the day. The property was insulated and pumped-wrapped in 2011.\r\n\r\nThe location is a particular highlight. Ard Na Mara is an established and prestigious residential setting within Malahide, with a shop conveniently located directly across the road. Malahide Village is approximately a 10-minute walk, offering an excellent selection of cafés, restaurants, boutiques and everyday amenities. Malahide Castle and its beautiful grounds, the coast and a host of recreational amenities are also close by.\r\n\r\nThere are a number of local schools in the surrounding area, while bus stops are just a few minutes' walk from the property, providing convenient transport links.\r\n\r\nThis is a rare opportunity to acquire a substantial detached home in one of Malahide's most established and desirable locations, with excellent potential to enhance and tailor the accommodation to suit individual requirements.\r\n\r\nVacant Property Refurbishment Grant: Having been vacant for over two years, this property qualifies for consideration under the Vacant Property Refurbishment Grant scheme, subject to the scheme’s terms and conditions.\r\n\r\nViewing is highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Prestigious Ard Na Mara location in Malahide\r\n\r\nSubstantial five-bedroom detached home with generous accommodation and Garage Space.\r\n\r\nVery large private rear garden offering excellent outdoor space and potential\r\n\r\nSignificant potential to enhance and modernise the accommodation throughout - Eligible for the Vacant Homes Grant.\r\n\r\nExtended rear accommodation providing additional living space\r\n\r\nAttic extension currently used as a bedroom, with a bathroom also located at this level\r\n\r\nWest-facing living accommodation enjoying excellent natural light\r\n\r\nGarage and generous overall property footprint\r\n\r\nConvenient amenities on the doorstep, including a shop directly across the road\r\n\r\nApprox. 10-minute walk to Malahide Village, with schools, transport links, Malahide Castle, coast, cafés, restaurants and local amenities all close by"
      },
      {
